{"synopsis":"“Siapa kau…?”\n“Aku Unryong.”\n\nSetelah 100 tahun latihan tertutup, akhirnya Unryong kembali menginjakkan kaki ke dunia. Namun, Sekte Kunlun yang dia ketahui selama ini sudah berubah karena termakan waktu.\n\n“Seharusnya kita saling membantu dalam masa-masa yang sulit, ‘kan?”\nSetelah hatinya tergerakkan kebaikan dari orang yang bahkan tidak dia kenal, dia memutuskan untuk menetap di Penginapan Kunlun.\n\nDengan seni beladirinya yang tidak tertandingi, Unryong mulai menjalani kehidupan barunya yang dipenuhi kehangatan sebagai koki di Penginapan Kunlun.","alternative_title":"천하제일 곤륜객잔","author":"Baekbo, Kim Jakka","artist":"Kim Juntae","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"485d1e78-e4ef-4163-a22e-7386465b70f4","number":"121","chapter":"121","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"42f46cd0-bce2-450f-b8d2-8c67731dffb1","number":"120","chapter":"120","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31"},{"chapter_id":"920c4881-5589-450e-802a-f7520dcd3807","number":"119","chapter":"119","title":"","date":"2026-07-30","released":"2026-07-30"},{"chapter_id":"09c404d8-01c4-4e68-9772-ed6aae2ea888","number":"118","chapter":"118","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"400d23b0-916b-4aa2-8cce-c23e6fd86608","number":"117","chapter":"117","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"51534b27-06f0-4855-aa45-7b923b374b0f","number":"116","chapter":"116","title":"","date":"2026-07-24","released":"2026-07-24"},{"chapter_id":"29d9b7fb-b32e-4ec8-bacc-82c06d64d4e3","number":"115","chapter":"115","title":"","date":"2026-04-25","released":"2026-04-25"},{"chapter_id":"6a1df770-fc3c-4777-a2f3-2e34706a9a12","number":"114","chapter":"114","title":"","date":"2026-04-24","released":"2026-04-24"},{"chapter_id":"36b697ed-9ed0-4501-aa28-4dde6eca61c8","number":"113","chapter":"113","title":"","date":"2026-04-23","released":"2026-04-23"},{"chapter_id":"ec881b6a-c2b7-4b1b-94d2-786392b5818a","number":"112","ch